Marks on notes. (P11)

F1  Fing1 : add fingering number 1 to note.
F2  Fing2 : add fingering number 2 to note.
F3  Fing3 : add fingering number 3 to note.
F4  Fing4 : add fingering number 4 to note.
F5  Fing5 : add fingering number 5 to note.

F6  Harmo : add harmonic 'o' to note.

F8  LRUD  : go to Left, Right, Up, Down menu for moving marks. (P13, 14)

F9  <--   : [<esc>] return to previous menu.

F10  -->  : goes to next Edit Mode menu.


