   Line ³ Dash ³  Dot ³ Wiggl ³ Arpeg ³ Cres< ³ Decrs>³ Rotat³ Centr³User¯³±
<alt>F1ÄÁÄÄF2ÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÄÁÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄF9ÄÄÁÄF10ÄÁÄ

F1  Line  : Makes straight line. (P7 = 0)  (Ref. 42)
F2  Dash  : Makes dashed line.   (P7= 1)
F3  Dot   : Makes dotted line.   (P7= -4)
F4  Wiggl : Makes wiggle line.   (P7= -1)
F5  Arpeg : Makes vertical wiggle - for arpeggio chord, etc. (P6=0, P7=-1)

F6  Cres< : Crescendo hairpin.  (P5 = 999, P7 >= 0)
F7  Decrs>: Decrescendo hairpin. (P5 = 999, P7 < 0)

F8  Rotat : Rotate the line. (P13)  (Ref. 45, 46)

F9  Centr : [CN] center the item on closest note or rest.

F10 User  : move to user-added commands.



-------------------------------------------------------------------------end---
