F3  -LfOff : offset left end of line to the left (P15 or P16=1, P17=offset)
F4  +LfOff : offset left end of line to the right
F5  0LfOff : remove offset of left end of line. (P15=0, P17=0)

F6  -RtOff : offset right end of line to the left (P16=1, P18=offset)
F7  +RtOff : offset right end of line to the right
F8  0RtOff : remove offset of right end of line. (P18=0)

