<alt>F1ÄÁÄÄF2ÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÄÁÄÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄF9ÄÁÄF10ÄÁ


F1  LfPed  : left pedal black/white. (P5)  (Ref. 90)
F2  MidPed : middle pedal black/white.
F3  RtPed  : right pedal black/white.

F4  -LfLin : move left end of line above pedal symbol to the left. (Ref. 94)
F5  +LfLin : move left end of line above pedal symbol to the right. (P8)  

F6  -RtLin : move right end of line above pedal symbol to the left. (P6)
F7  +RtLin : move right end of line above pedal symbol to the right.

F8  -^-Peds: change to linear pedal symbols. (P7)

F9  Centr  : [CN] center the item on closest note or rest.

F10 User   : move to user-added commands.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------end---
