ÄÄÄF1ÄÄÁÄÄF2ÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÄÁÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄF9ÄÄÁÄF10ÄÁ
       
Graphic piano pedals.

F1  -Siz  : decrease size factor. (P9)  (Ref. 94)
F2  +Siz  : increase size factor.

F5  LfBrk : bracket at left end of line -           (P11)  (Ref. 95)
                     cycles through bracket up, arrow, down, none. 
F6  RtBrk : bracket at right end of line -          (P12)
                     cycles through bracket up, arrow, down, none. 

F9  <---  : [<esc>] return to previous menu.





