  -Line ³ +Line³5-Line³Siz-.05³Siz+.05³ Siz=1 ³BtmLin#³      ³ Centr³User¯³
<alt>F1ÄÁÄÄF2ÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÄÁÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄF9ÄÄÁÄF10ÄÁ

F1  -Line   : remove staff line.(If P7=-1, staff is invisible. Ref. 99, 100)
F2  +Line   : add staff line.
F3  5Line   : set to normal 5-line staff. (P7=0)

F4  Siz-.05 : reduce staff size by .05. (P5)  (Ref. 98)
F5  Siz+.05 : increase staff size by .05.
F6  Siz=1   : set to default size. (P5=0 is same as P5=1.)

F7  BtmLin# : set line # level for bottom of special staff. (P7) (Ref. 98)
               (For percussion staff, etc. Use F1, 2 to set number of lines.)

F9  Centr   : [CN] center the item on closest note or rest.

F10 User    : move to user-added commands.




