Numbers.
F7 JstOn : justify numbers (for fingering, etc.)  F8 JsOff : justify off.
             (P16=1)                                           (P16=0)
<alt>F9  <--     : [<esc>] return to previous menu.
<alt>F10  -->    : go to next menu.

<alt>F1  -OffSet : offset item from P3 value to left. (P15) (MA 5.05)
<alt>F2  +OffSet : offset item from P3 value to right.
<alt>F3  0OffSet : no offset.
<alt>F4  -Size   : decrease size. (P6)  (Ref. 117, 118)
<alt>F5  +Size   : increase size. (P6)
<alt>F6  Size 1  : default size.
<alt>F7  +Spread : increase spread between numbers. (P14)  (Ref. 120)
<alt>F8  NoSpread: default spacing of numbers.

<alt>F9  Num.1   : set number to 1.
<alt>F10 Ltr A   : set number to letter A -- P5=1001.  (Ref. 117)
