 Acci1 ³ Acci2³ Acci3³ Acci4³ Acci5 ³ Acci6 ³ AcciDn³ AcciUp³JustOff³JstOn³
<alt>F1ÁÄÄF2ÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÄÁÄÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄÄF9ÄÄÁÄF10ÄÁ

F1  Acci1  : 1st accidental for irregular key signature. (P8)  (MA 6.19)
F2  Acci2  : 2nd accidental.  (P9)
F3  Acci3  : 3rd accidental.  (P10
F4  Acci4  : 4th accidental.  (P11)
F5  Acci5  : 5th accidental.  (P12)
F6  Acci6  : 6th accidental.  (P13)

F7  AcciDn : for last accidental set, move down 1 step.
                     (last 2 digits of parameter hold step level)
F8  AcciUp : for last accidental set, move up 1 step.

F9  JustOff: the key signature will be ignored by justifying procedures.
F10 JstOn  : the key signature will justify in the normal way. (P14) (MA 6.19)






