F1  -Offset : offset item to left.  (P15)
F2  +Offset : offset item to right.
F3  NoOff   : no offset.

F4  2/4     : P5 = top number, P6 = bottom number.  (Ref. 174)
F5  3/4     :
F6  4/4     :
F7  5/4     :


F8  ›       : alla breve (cut time).
F9  C       : common time.

F10 User  : move to user-added commands.





-------------------------------------------------------------------------end---
