<alt>F1ÄÁÄÄF2ÄÄÄÁÄÄF3ÄÄÁÄÄF4ÄÄÄÁÄÄF5ÄÄÄÁÄÄF6ÄÄÄÁÄÄF7ÄÄÁÄÄF8ÄÄÁÄÄF9ÄÄÁÄF10ÄÁ

F1  StrQt  : String Quartet setup (treble, treble, alto, bass).
F2  Voc+Pno: Three-staff vocal system (treble, treble, bass).
F3  SATB   : Four-part choral setup (treble, treble, treble-8, bass).
F4  Chr+Pno: SABT chorus plus piano.
F5  Orch1  : Basic orchestra setup.
F6  Orch2  : Extended orchestra setup.

F8  Reset  : Clear current setup to make way for new setup.

F9  Start  : Start input of notes, rests, etc.









-------------------------------------------------------------------------end---
