Input Mode. Barlines (measure lines)

F1  M      : [Mn]   Normal bar line (measure), number of staves up may follow.
F2  MD     : [MDn]  Thin double bar.
F3  MH     : [MHn]  Double bar with heavy bar to right.
F4  MR     : [MRn]  Repeat bar with dots to the right.
F5  ML     : [MLn]  Repeat bar with dots to the left.
F6  MRD    : [MRDn] Double repeat bar with dots on both sides.
F7  MS     : [MSn]  Bar made up of veritcal dashes.
F8  MI     : [MIn]  Invisible barline. (Measure Invisible)

F9  <--    : Return to previous menu.

<alt>F1  1 Staff  : Bar covers only 1 staff.
<alt>F2  2 Staves : Bar covers 2 staves.
  .          .       .
  .          .       .
<alt>F9  9 Staves : Bar covers 9 staves.  (Other numbers may be typed.)
